      "content": "that makes sense. it's like a proactive investment... so, to wrap up the speech, could you give me a closing statement that really drives home the idea that anyone who opposes this kind of global responsibility is essentially arguing for a selfish and short-sighted worldview? just something that makes it clear there isn't really a valid moral argument on the other side.",
